OL,3,CCharity urges Welsh Government to
OL,4,Cinvest in breast cancer after targets
OL,5,Cmissed
OL,7,FA leading UK charity is calling on the
OL,8,FWelsh Government to invest and
OL,9,Fprioritise breast cancer services in
OL,10,FWales.
OL,12,FIt comes after a new report by Breast
OL,13,FCancer Now found that the 75% waiting
OL,14,Ftime target for treatment was only met
OL,15,Fthree times since the Suspected Cancer
OL,16,FPathway was introduced in 2020.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/8
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
