PN,43502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F435A1785417510
OL,3,CCharity urges Welsh Government to
OL,4,Cinvest in breast cancer after targets
OL,5,Cmissed
OL,7,FLatest waiting times published on 23
OL,8,FJuly found only 60% (116) of patients
OL,9,Fwere seen within 62 days after being
OL,10,Finitially referred, with huge
OL,11,Fvariation across health boards.
OL,13,FBreast Cancer Now is calling on the
OL,14,FWelsh Government to invest in
OL,15,Fimproving breast cancer waiting times
OL,16,Fafter raising concerns there is a
OL,17,F'complacency' in Wales.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/8
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
