PN,43503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F435A1785417510
OL,3,CCharity urges Welsh Government to
OL,4,Cinvest in breast cancer after targets
OL,5,Cmissed
OL,7,FThe charity says Welsh health boards
OL,8,Fmust be better supported to identify
OL,9,Fand address the underlying causes of
OL,10,Fdelays, along with measuring key
OL,11,Fstages of the cancer pathway.
OL,13,FFor earlier diagnosis of breast cancer
OL,14,Fin Wales, the charity is urging the
OL,15,Fnew government to prioritise meeting
OL,16,Fthe 70% minimum standard and aim for
OL,17,Fthe 80% achievable standard, after the
OL,18,FNHS breast screening uptake target was
OL,19,Fmissed in Wales for the past 7 years.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/8
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
