OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F435A1785417510
OL,3,CCharity urges Welsh Government to
OL,4,Cinvest in breast cancer after targets
OL,5,Cmissed
OL,7,FMelanie Sturtevant, associate director
OL,8,Fof policy, evidence and influencing at
OL,9,FBreast Cancer Now said:
OL,11,F"We have a bold vision that by 2050,
OL,12,Feveryone diagnosed with breast cancer,
OL,13,Flives and lives well, but to see this
OL,14,Fbecome reality in Wales we need real
OL,15,Faction and ambition from the new
OL,16,Fgovernment for quicker and earlier
OL,17,Fdiagnosis of breast cancer to save and
OL,18,Fimprove lives.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/8
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
