PN,43505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F435A1785417510
OL,3,CCharity urges Welsh Government to
OL,4,Cinvest in breast cancer after targets
OL,5,Cmissed
OL,7,F"We're ready to work with the new
OL,8,Fgovernment to ensure people in Wales
OL,9,Fare diagnosed quicker and start
OL,10,Ftreatment faster through reduced
OL,11,Fwaiting times, and earlier with
OL,12,Fimproved breast screening uptake
OL,13,Fthrough a breast screening awareness
OL,14,Fcampaign, and provision of more
OL,15,Fconvenient, flexible access to breast
OL,16,Fscreening services."
OL,18,FBreast cancer is the most common
OL,19,Fcancer in women in Wales, with 2,800
OL,20,Fpeople diagnosed each year.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G5/8
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
