PN,43506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F435A1785417510
OL,3,CCharity urges Welsh Government to
OL,4,Cinvest in breast cancer after targets
OL,5,Cmissed
OL,7,FWith this number set to rise by 23%
OL,8,F(3,449) by 2035, urgent action is
OL,9,Fneeded from the new government to
OL,10,Fensure early diagnosis of breast
OL,11,Fcancer is a priority.
OL,13,FIn a statement, the Welsh Government
OL,14,Fsaid:
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G6/8
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,436,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F435A1785417510
OL,3,CCharity urges Welsh Government to
OL,4,Cinvest in breast cancer after targets
OL,5,Cmissed
OL,7,F"We recognise that performance against
OL,8,Fcancer waiting times is not where we
OL,9,Fwant it to be which is why, as a new
OL,10,FGovernment, we are taking decisive
OL,11,Faction on cancer by developing a 10-
OL,12,Fyear National Cancer Strategy to
OL,13,Ftransform the way the health service
OL,14,Fprevents, diagnoses, and treats the
OL,15,Fdisease.
OL,17,F"The strategy will set out an
OL,18,Fambitious vision for cancer care in
OL,19,FWales. This will include emphasis on
OL,20,Fearlier diagnosis of cancer, including
OL,21,Fbreast cancer.
OL,26,@oD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G7/8
