PN,43508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F435A1785417510
OL,3,CCharity urges Welsh Government to
OL,4,Cinvest in breast cancer after targets
OL,5,Cmissed
OL,7,F"Optimal pathways of care for all
OL,8,Ftypes of cancer will be developed in
OL,9,Fpartnership with patients and clinical
OL,10,Fexperts to ensure that modern,
OL,11,Fevidence-based care is available
OL,12,Fwherever a person lives in Wales.
OL,14,F"In the meantime, NHS Performance and
OL,15,FImprovement is working with health
OL,16,Fboards in Wales to improve cancer
OL,17,Fwaiting time performance."
OL,26,@vD@AOUyD@ZO]
